<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Destec Energy cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Destec Energy cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities anaylst Daniele Seitz said in a research note she lowered her recommendation on Destec Energy Inc to hold from buy based on the company's agreement to be sold for &quot;$21.65 per share to a combination of NGC Corp and AES Corp.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Destec shares were unchanged at 20-1/2 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
